      "updated_at": "2018-04-22T17:11:20Z",
      "body": "I agree @tomekjordan, but as Portugal you have to have an certified accounting software all the orders and tax have to go to that software has Magento is not a certified accounting software. So we have to anonymize or delete the customer info.\r\nI going to start an GDPR module, with the point's i have added on top.\r\nMost of them optional, so people can activate and deactivate them as needed.\r\nOpen-Sourced of course.",
